#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:1
msgid "接入、资源装配与源码 SDK 合同"
msgstr "Integration, resource assembly and source-SDK contract"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:3
msgid ""
"下一代接入合同。已实现模式及实际验收见[当前交付](../delivery/README.md)；精确 schema 和公共 API 以 "
"`tools/configure/` 与当前头文件为准。示意命令不构成三块开发板的物理资格或产品发布承诺。"
msgstr ""
"Next-generation integration contract. See [current "
"delivery](../delivery/README.md) for implemented modes and actual acceptance."
" `tools/configure/` and current public headers define exact schemas and APIs."
" Illustrative commands do not qualify three physical Boards or promise "
"product releases."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:5
msgid ""
"本文说明通用平台如何接入 CPU、SoC、Board、外部器件、协议和组件，以及外部工程如何形成可审核的固件。总体边界见 [下一代平台设计](next-"
"generation-platform.md)，开发、验证和维护流程见 [工程手册](engineering-handbook.md)。"
msgstr ""
"This document explains integration of CPUs, SoCs, Boards, external devices, "
"protocols and components, and how external projects produce reviewable "
"firmware. See [platform design](next-generation-platform.md) for boundaries "
"and [engineering handbook](engineering-handbook.md) for development, "
"validation and maintenance."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:7
msgid ""
"当前生产入口只有 STM32F4，已迁入 F407VE／ZG 及四个独立 Board "
"包。现在不连接硬件；源资料、软件实现、编译链接、模型行为和物理资格必须分开陈述。未知的实际 PCB revision、跳线、电气或器件型号保持未知。"
msgstr ""
"The sole current production entry is STM32F4, covering migrated F407VE/ZG "
"implementations and four independent Board packages. Hardware is not "
"connected at this stage; source material, software implementation, "
"compilation/linking, model behavior and physical qualification must be stated"
" separately. Unknown actual PCB revision, jumpers, electrical conditions or "
"device models remain unknown."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:9
msgid "1. 第一原则与工具边界"
msgstr "1. First principles and tool boundaries"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:11
msgid "接入不是把所有硬件描述转换为一个运行时设备树。它是提交有限事实、选择已维护能力、检查资源，再显式装配静态对象。"
msgstr ""
"Integration does not turn every hardware description into a runtime device "
"tree. It submits bounded facts, selects maintained capabilities, checks "
"resources and explicitly assembles static objects."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:13
msgid ""
"使用 C11、CMake、Ninja、TOML 装配输入、JSON 硬件事实和一个窄 Python 校验/生成工具。核心默认不需要 "
"heap、运行时字符串查找、自动探测或后台 worker。"
msgstr ""
"Use C11, CMake, Ninja, TOML assembly inputs, JSON hardware facts and a narrow"
" Python validator/generator. The default core needs no heap, runtime string "
"lookup, discovery or background workers."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:14
msgid ""
"默认入口是外部工程的 `assembly.toml`。硬件输入分为 SoC、Board、assembly 三类，一次验证建立冻结 typed "
"IR；`resolved.json` 是其单向审计投影。"
msgstr ""
"The default entry is `assembly.toml` in an external project. Hardware inputs "
"comprise SoC, Board and assembly facts. One validation establishes frozen "
"typed IR; `resolved.json` is its one-way audit projection."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:15
msgid "CMake 仍是代码目标和代码依赖的权威。生成器不生成组件依赖图、业务线程、产品 main 或调度策略。"
msgstr ""
"CMake remains authoritative for code targets and dependencies. Generators "
"produce no component dependency graph, business threads, product main or "
"scheduling policy."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:16
msgid ""
"实例选择使用 TOML schema 2，SoC/Board 事实保持 JSON。工具只解析这一个装配输入；Kconfig、CMake cache "
"和旧生成头不形成平行配置权威。"
msgstr ""
"Instance selection uses TOML schema 2; SoC/Board facts remain JSON. Tools "
"parse only that assembly input; Kconfig, CMake cache and old generated "
"headers do not become parallel authorities."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:17
msgid ""
"目录可采用 `core/ arch/ soc/ io/ os/ components/ tools/ tests/`；Board 可位于独立 "
"package。层名说明职责，不要求每个层、端口或对象成为一个独立 translation unit。"
msgstr ""
"Directories may use `core/ arch/ soc/ io/ os/ components/ tools/ tests/`; a "
"Board may reside in an independent package. Layer names define "
"responsibilities, without requiring every layer, port or object to become a "
"separate translation unit."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:18
msgid "未维护的能力不因 SDK 有宏、路由表有 AF 值、同系列有示例而自动可用。新路由、新 DMA 模式、新控制器分别接入。"
msgstr ""
"Unmaintained capabilities do not become available merely because the SDK has "
"a macro, a route table has an AF value or another family member has an "
"example. Integrate new routes, DMA modes and controllers separately."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:20
msgid "2. 各类接入拥有的事实"
msgstr "2. Facts owned by each integration category"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "类别"
msgstr "Category"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "拥有的事实和实现"
msgstr "Owned facts and implementation"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "明确不拥有"
msgstr "Explicitly not owned"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "CPU / Arch"
msgstr "CPU / Arch"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "指令集、异常上下文、屏障、原子/临界区、FPU 上下文和 ABI 约定"
msgstr ""
"Instruction set, exception context, barriers, atomics/critical sections, FPU "
"context and ABI conventions."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "具体 PCB、具体控制器 IRQ/DMA、产品设备"
msgstr "Specific PCBs, controller IRQ/DMA assignments or product devices."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "SoC"
msgstr "SoC"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "精确料号/封装/密度、内存域、控制器、时钟约束、IRQ/EXTI、DMA、pin/AF 路由、Flash 几何、私有 SDK"
msgstr ""
"Exact part/package/density, memory domains, controllers, clock constraints, "
"IRQ/EXTI, DMA, pin/AF routes, Flash geometry and private SDK."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "Board 接线、应用 role、产品分区"
msgstr "Board wiring, application roles or product partitions."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "Board"
msgstr "Board"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "PCB/source revision、晶振、电气电平、焊接器件、连接器、跳线条件、初始安全电平和复核接线"
msgstr ""
"PCB/source revisions, oscillators, electrical levels, fitted devices, "
"connectors, jumper conditions, initial safe levels and reviewed wiring."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "改写芯片密度、选主传感器、创建业务任务"
msgstr ""
"Overriding chip density, selecting the primary sensor or creating business "
"tasks."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "外部器件 driver"
msgstr "External device driver"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "器件命令/寄存器、转换算法、初始化顺序、器件时序要求和错误语义"
msgstr ""
"Device commands/registers, conversion algorithms, initialization order, "
"timing requirements and error semantics."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "默认 GPIO、默认总线编号、产品采样策略"
msgstr "Default GPIOs, default bus numbers or product sampling policy."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "protocol core"
msgstr "protocol core"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "帧格式、解析/编码、有界状态机和协议时间规则"
msgstr ""
"Frame formats, parsing/encoding, bounded state machines and protocol timing "
"rules."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "默认 UART、RS485 DE 引脚、线程、客户业务"
msgstr "Default UARTs, RS485 DE pins, threads or customer business logic."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "component"
msgstr "component"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "可复用算法或服务、窄端口、明确容量和执行上下文"
msgstr ""
"Reusable algorithms/services, narrow ports, explicit capacity and execution "
"context."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "隐式创建 worker、自动找依赖、固定产品存储"
msgstr ""
"Implicit workers, automatic dependency discovery or fixed product storage."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "product / application"
msgstr "product / application"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "main、workers、应用 role、私有协议、配置策略、分区、升级/健康/制造策略"
msgstr ""
"main, workers, application roles, private protocols, configuration policy, "
"partitions and update/health/manufacturing policy."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "让通用平台反向依赖其源码"
msgstr "Making the shared platform depend on product source."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:32
msgid ""
"SoC provider 实现公共 IO/核心合同，并使用 Arch。器件 driver 使用总线、GPIO、时间等窄端口；协议 core 不依赖 "
"Board 或 OS；组件 adapter 才连接 IO/OS。外部 assembly 连接各实现。Board 声明板载器件的事实，不因此成为器件 "
"driver 的所有者。"
msgstr ""
"SoC providers implement public I/O/core contracts and use Arch. Device "
"drivers use narrow bus/GPIO/time ports; protocol cores depend on neither "
"Board nor OS; component adapters connect I/O/OS. External assemblies wire "
"implementations together. Declaring onboard devices does not make the Board "
"the device-driver owner."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:34
msgid ""
"厂商 SDK、内核实现头和可变 controller 状态保持私有；公共接口不透出其结构体。STM32 与 GD32 "
"的相似名称不能证明寄存器兼容或驱动可以直接复用。"
msgstr ""
"Vendor SDKs, kernel implementation headers and mutable controller state stay "
"private; public interfaces do not expose their structures. Similar STM32/GD32"
" names do not prove register compatibility or direct driver reuse."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:36
msgid "3. 三类输入及少量文件模板"
msgstr "3. Three input categories and small file templates"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:38
msgid "SoC package"
msgstr "SoC package"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:40
msgid "一个维护中的 SoC package 通常包含："
msgstr "A maintained SoC package typically includes:"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:51
msgid ""
"系列目录复用代码，`soc.json` 分别定义 STM32F407VET6、STM32F407ZGT6 的精确物理事实；`devices.json` "
"记录官方器件宏、启动和 IRQ 编译事实。型号、封装、Flash、SRAM 域和 IRQ 表不能被家族字符串代替，编译目录不扩大运行时模式支持。"
msgstr ""
"The series directory reuses code. `soc.json` defines exact physical facts for"
" STM32F407VET6 and STM32F407ZGT6 separately; `devices.json` records official "
"device macros, startup and IRQ facts for compilation. A family string cannot "
"replace part number, package, Flash, SRAM domains or IRQ tables. The compile "
"catalogue does not expand runtime-mode support."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:60
msgid "4. 解析、生成与 CMake 装配"
msgstr "4. Resolution, generation and CMake assembly"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:62
msgid "配置过程必须按固定顺序执行："
msgstr "Configuration must follow this fixed order:"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:64
msgid "读取 assembly，定位唯一 Board，按其精确料号定位 SoC；检查 schema、版本和依赖锁。"
msgstr ""
"Read the assembly, locate one Board and its exact SoC part, then check "
"schemas, versions and dependency locks."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:65
msgid "校验 package containment、声明 inputs、资料中的已知/未知条件；展开被选中的 binding 与器件。"
msgstr ""
"Check package containment, declared inputs and known/unknown source "
"conditions; expand selected bindings and devices."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:66
msgid "建立资源占用表，检查模式能力、冲突、clock、IRQ、memory、ABI 和 layout。"
msgstr ""
"Build resource claims; check mode capabilities, conflicts, clocks, IRQs, "
"memory, ABI and layout."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:67
msgid "原子写入单份 `resolved.json`，记录所有决定、拒绝项和输入摘要。"
msgstr ""
"Atomically write one `resolved.json` recording decisions, rejections and "
"input digests."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:68
msgid "从该 IR 导出硬件配置头、只读资源表及 linker 输入；CMake 读取必要选项并按自己声明的目标依赖编译。"
msgstr ""
"Derive hardware headers, read-only resource tables and linker inputs from IR;"
" CMake reads necessary selections and builds its declared dependencies."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:69
msgid "对实际 ELF/map/BIN 验证 vector、startup、handler、区域容量和产物身份；结果成为证据，不能反向冒充硬件资格。"
msgstr ""
"Verify vectors, startup, handlers, region capacities and artifact identity in"
" actual ELF/map/BIN outputs. Results become evidence without posing as "
"hardware qualification."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:71
msgid ""
"`resolved.json` 保存 schema、选中 package/料号/后端、有效选项、clock/memory/ABI、资源 "
"claims、已选器件、证据限制和输入 hash。它不是 CMake target 依赖图，也不包含平台猜测的业务线程、role 或领域策略。"
msgstr ""
"`resolved.json` retains schema, packages/parts/backends, effective options, "
"clock/memory/ABI, resource claims, devices, limitations and input hashes. It "
"is neither a CMake dependency graph nor guessed business threads, roles or "
"domain policy."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:73
msgid ""
"派生输出都来自该 IR。不得存在 `.config`、旧生成头、独立 Board 默认宏等回退真相。生成失败使本次配置失效，不得继续使用上次成功生成的 "
"bundle；先写临时目录，完整成功后切换。不同 Board/backend/profile 使用独立 build root。"
msgstr ""
"All derived outputs come from that IR. No `.config`, old headers or separate "
"Board default macros become fallback authorities. Failed generation "
"invalidates configuration; never consume the prior bundle. Write to a "
"temporary directory and switch only after complete success. Separate "
"Board/backend/profile combinations use separate roots."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:75
msgid ""
"CMake 的每个库显式声明自己的代码依赖、公共头与私有 SDK 编译面。assembly 选择硬件实例和模式，不能替代 "
"`target_link_libraries()`。生成器不扫描任意业务源码推断需要什么组件，也不自动链接所有 driver。若代码目标要求的能力与 "
"resolved 配置矛盾，配置应失败。"
msgstr ""
"Each CMake library declares code dependencies, public headers and private SDK"
" compile surfaces explicitly. Assembly selects hardware instances/modes "
"without replacing `target_link_libraries()`. Generators neither infer "
"component needs from arbitrary business source nor link all drivers. Target "
"capability requirements contradicting resolved configuration must fail."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:77
msgid ""
"静态硬件 descriptors 可以由工具生成；可变上下文和真正的构造/init 仍有显式所属实现。产品 main "
"负责所需组件和器件的初始化顺序以及调度启动。平台不因一个器件节点出现就创建采样任务。"
msgstr ""
"Tools may generate static descriptors; mutable contexts and actual "
"construction/init still have explicit implementation owners. Product main "
"owns component/device initialization order and scheduler start. A device node"
" does not create a sampling task."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:79
msgid "5. 资源占用与编译前检查"
msgstr "5. Resource ownership and precompile checks"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "资源"
msgstr "Resource"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "必须检查的条件"
msgstr "Required checks"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "pin"
msgstr "pin"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "精确封装具有该 pin；route 在 reviewed allowlist；AF/方向/电气约束满足；SWD、板载器件与选中功能不冲突"
msgstr ""
"The exact package has the pin; routes are allowlisted and reviewed; "
"AF/direction/electrical constraints hold; SWD, onboard devices and selected "
"functions do not conflict."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "controller"
msgstr "controller"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "provider 实现所选模式；物理 controller 单一拥有；共享总线由同一个 owner 派生 child"
msgstr ""
"The provider implements the selected mode; one owner holds the physical "
"controller; shared-bus children derive from that owner."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "SPI child"
msgstr "SPI child"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "CS 独立；mode/频率/word width 可在已维护配置中满足；串行仲裁明确"
msgstr ""
"Separate CS lines; mode, frequency and word width must fit maintained "
"configurations; explicit serialized arbitration."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "I2C child"
msgstr "I2C child"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "地址和 mux 层级合法；地址冲突拒绝；controller 与 mux 模式均已实现"
msgstr ""
"Legal addresses/mux levels; conflicting addresses rejected; controller and "
"mux modes both implemented."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "DMA"
msgstr "DMA"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid ""
"按实际 DMA controller/stream/channel/request 模型检查；所选 route 合法；独占资源互斥；模式已有实现"
msgstr ""
"Validate the actual DMA controller/stream/channel/request model, legal "
"routes, exclusive-resource conflicts and implemented modes."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "IRQ"
msgstr "IRQ"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "每个 vector 有唯一 provider 或显式有界 dispatcher；优先级、grouping、OS 调用权限吻合"
msgstr ""
"Each vector has one provider or explicit bounded dispatcher; priority, "
"grouping and kernel-call permissions agree."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "EXTI"
msgstr "EXTI"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "检查 line/port mux 独占、边沿模式、共享 vector、事件容量和优先级，不能只看 pin 名"
msgstr ""
"Check exclusive line/port muxing, edges, shared vectors, event capacity and "
"priority rather than only pin names."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "timer/PWM"
msgstr "timer/PWM"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid ""
"检查 timer/channel、timebase、共享 PSC/ARR/base mode 和 trigger；同 timer 的 channel "
"不视为独立时基"
msgstr ""
"Check timer/channel, timebase, shared PSC/ARR/base mode and triggers. "
"Channels on one timer are not independent timebases."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "ADC"
msgstr "ADC"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "检查 channel、sample time、sequence、trigger、参考电压条件和具体采样模式；DMA/stream 单独维护"
msgstr ""
"Check channels, sampling time, sequences, triggers, reference-voltage "
"conditions and exact sampling modes; maintain DMA/stream separately."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "watchdog"
msgstr "watchdog"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "检查已维护 IWDG 范围、LSI 误差及启用不可逆效果；feed/健康政策仍归外部产品"
msgstr ""
"Check maintained IWDG range, LSI error and irreversible enabling. "
"Feeding/health policy remains external."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "clock"
msgstr "clock"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "晶振、PLL、总线、Flash wait state、外设频率和后端 timebase 约束满足已维护 profile"
msgstr ""
"Oscillators, PLLs, buses, Flash wait states, peripheral frequencies and "
"backend timebase meet maintained profiles."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "memory"
msgstr "memory"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "精确物理域、DMA 可达性、alignment、栈/池/队列预算、layout/erase block 边界和镜像容量"
msgstr ""
"Exact physical domains, DMA reachability, alignment, stack/pool/queue "
"budgets, layout/erase boundaries and image capacity."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "ABI"
msgstr "ABI"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "CPU/Thumb/FPU/float ABI 一致；FreeRTOS port 正确；精确型号宏来自有效配置"
msgstr ""
"Consistent CPU/Thumb/FPU/float ABI, correct FreeRTOS port and exact-part "
"macros from resolved configuration."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:97
msgid ""
"resource claim 必须指出实体资源键、owner、使用模式和来源。错误例如“DMA1 stream X 同时由 A 和 B "
"声明”，而不是只报“配置不合法”。工具只检查显式选择，不自动寻找另一个 DMA stream、改 pin 或降低 clock。"
msgstr ""
"Resource claims must identify physical resource keys, owners, modes and "
"origins. Diagnostics say “DMA1 stream X is claimed by A and B”, not merely "
"“invalid configuration”. Tools validate explicit choices without finding "
"alternate streams, changing pins or lowering clocks."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:99
msgid ""
"SPI/I2C bus 共享不等于重复声明 controller。总线由单一 provider 管理，child 只持有其有界引用；SPI CS 或 "
"I2C 同层地址重复要拒绝。直接单执行者调用与显式queue/service "
"adapter分别声明：共享路径只有adapter执行者推进controller，client等待不接管执行。短锁只保护提交/控制元数据，不跨DMA生命周期持有task"
" mutex，器件driver不隐式依赖kernel锁。"
msgstr ""
"Sharing SPI/I2C buses does not mean declaring controllers twice. One provider"
" manages the bus; children retain bounded references. Duplicate SPI CS or "
"same-level I2C addresses fail. Direct single-executor calls and explicit "
"queue/service adapters are distinct: only the adapter executor advances "
"shared controllers; waiting clients do not take over. Short locks protect "
"admission/control metadata, never hold task mutexes across DMA lifetimes. "
"Device drivers do not implicitly require kernel locks."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:101
msgid ""
"真实共享 IRQ 允许使用 SoC 声明的静态 dispatcher，检查 handler 清单和有界执行条件；不允许两个强符号争抢 "
"vector，也不引入任意运行时注册。IRQ body 的响应/结算与 task/worker 的后续处理分别有所属者。"
msgstr ""
"Real shared IRQs may use SoC-declared static dispatchers with checked handler"
" lists and bounded execution. Two strong symbols cannot compete for one "
"vector; arbitrary runtime registration is excluded. IRQ response/settlement "
"and subsequent task/worker processing have separate owners."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:103
msgid ""
"FreeRTOS 保留 SysTick/PendSV/SVC 等被其 port 使用的资源。IRQ priority grouping "
"统一配置；调用内核的 ISR 必须满足该 port 的 syscall priority 规则，高优先级 ISR 禁止使用相应 OS API。备用 "
"timebase 若占用 timer，也进入同一资源表。"
msgstr ""
"FreeRTOS reserves port resources including SysTick/PendSV/SVC. Configure "
"priority grouping consistently; kernel-calling ISRs must meet the port’s "
"syscall-priority rules, while higher-priority ISRs cannot use those OS APIs. "
"Alternate timer timebases enter the same claims table."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:105
msgid "clock、memory 与 ABI 的具体边界"
msgstr "Specific clock, memory and ABI boundaries"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:107
msgid ""
"Board 提供实际 HSE/LSE、电气条件和必要跳线事实；SoC 提供合法约束与已维护 profile；assembly 选择 "
"profile。controller 不独立重配全局 clock，driver 不重复设置 NVIC grouping。没有实现动态 clock "
"切换时，运行期要求切换直接报告不支持。"
msgstr ""
"Boards supply actual HSE/LSE, electrical and jumper facts; SoCs supply legal "
"constraints and maintained profiles; assemblies choose profiles. Controllers "
"do not reconfigure global clocks independently; drivers do not reset NVIC "
"grouping. Without implemented dynamic-clock switching, runtime switch "
"requests return unsupported."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:109
msgid ""
"各 SRAM 域分别声明地址、大小、初始化方式、DMA 可达性和用途限制。不能把 STM32 CCM 当作默认 DMA SRAM，也不能把全部物理 "
"SRAM 合成一个未经维护的 linker heap。初始阶段只启用已实现且已检查的域，其余域保持未维护。"
msgstr ""
"Declare each SRAM domain’s address, size, initialization, DMA reachability "
"and usage restrictions separately. STM32 CCM is not default DMA SRAM; all "
"physical SRAM cannot become one unmaintained linker heap. Initially enable "
"only implemented, checked domains; others remain unmaintained."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:111
msgid ""
"静态 DMA buffer 可用 linker section、alignment 和 map "
"检查；调用者动态传入的指针仍须在执行时验证可达域与对齐。编译检查不能替代 borrow/settlement 生命周期。内存预算区分 MSP、任务栈、OS"
" 对象、IO buffer、组件 workspace 和可选 libc heap。"
msgstr ""
"Linker sections, alignment and maps validate static DMA buffers; runtime "
"validation still checks caller-provided pointers for reachability/alignment. "
"Compile checks cannot replace borrowing/settlement lifetimes. Budgets "
"distinguish MSP, task stacks, OS objects, I/O buffers, component workspaces "
"and optional libc heaps."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:113
msgid ""
"Flash 布局使用精确料号的 erase geometry，拒绝越界、重叠、重复 ID 和不满足擦除边界的 region，并且只允许一个 "
"image。`resolved.flash` 保留完整物理几何，`resolved.layout` 选择链接镜像窗口；窗口不创建 Flash ACL "
"或产品写权限。所选 STM32F407VET6/ZGT6 支持经过审查的偏移镜像、512 字节向量对齐、实际 vendor vector symbol "
"和配套 startup/ELF/BIN "
"检查。准确字段和边界见[装配参考](../reference/configuration/assembly.md#physical-flash-and-"
"the-selected-image)。"
msgstr ""
"Flash layouts use exact-part erase geometry and reject overflow, overlap, "
"duplicate IDs and non-erase-aligned regions, selecting only one image. "
"`resolved.flash` retains complete physical geometry, while `resolved.layout` "
"selects a linked image window; a window creates no Flash ACL or product write"
" permission. Selected STM32F407VET6/ZGT6 support reviewed offset images, "
"512-byte vector alignment, actual vendor vector symbols and matching "
"startup/ELF/BIN checks. See the [assembly "
"reference](../reference/configuration/assembly.md#physical-flash-and-the-"
"selected-image) for exact fields and boundaries."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:115
msgid ""
"偏移链接只建立软件镜像边界。外部产品仍须提供进入 Reset_Handler 的有效启动路径、初始机器状态、认证、激活及恢复政策。现有 F407 "
"running-image handoff 保留 PRIMASK=1，startup 不主动解除屏蔽；裸机或 FreeRTOS "
"链接结果不建立通用运行态交接或 FreeRTOS handoff 资格。"
msgstr ""
"Offset linking establishes a software image boundary only. External products "
"still supply a valid boot path to Reset_Handler, initial machine state, "
"authentication, activation and recovery policy. The existing F407 running-"
"image handoff retains PRIMASK=1 and startup does not unmask it; baremetal or "
"FreeRTOS links do not establish general running-image transfer or FreeRTOS "
"handoff qualification."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:117
msgid ""
"CPU 编译选项、FPU 启用、异常上下文和 kernel port 必须一致。工具链及所有预编译输入的 ABI 记录到身份中。当前推荐源码 "
"SDK；不默认承诺不同 compiler/version/flags 之间的 installed binary ABI。"
msgstr ""
"CPU flags, FPU enabling, exception contexts and kernel ports must agree. "
"Record toolchain and all precompiled-input ABIs in identity. Source SDKs are "
"recommended; installed-binary ABI compatibility across "
"compilers/versions/flags is not promised by default."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:119
msgid "可由哪些阶段证明"
msgstr "What each stage can establish"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:121
msgid ""
"生成前检查负责事实一致性和资源冲突；C11 `_Static_assert` 与类型系统负责容量、类型、常量关系；linker/map/ELF "
"检查负责镜像布局、符号、handler 和对象保留。物理波形、电气电平、clock 偏差、IRQ latency、DMA 终态和长期负载需要实板证据。"
msgstr ""
"Pregeneration validates fact consistency and conflicts. C11 `_Static_assert` "
"and types establish capacity/type/constant relationships. Linker/map/ELF "
"checks establish layouts, symbols, handlers and retention. Waveforms, "
"electrical levels, clock error, IRQ latency, DMA terminal states and "
"sustained loads need physical evidence."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:123
msgid "6. 实例名、应用 role 与静态成本"
msgstr "6. Instance names, application roles and static cost"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:125
msgid ""
"`USART1` 是 SoC controller 名；`j1_uart`、`bme280_ext0` 是 assembly "
"的稳定实例名；`console`、`ambient_sensor` 是外部应用 role。Board 只提供物理资源，不决定哪个器件是产品的主传感器。"
msgstr ""
"`USART1` names a SoC controller; `j1_uart` and `bme280_ext0` are stable "
"assembly instance names; `console` and `ambient_sensor` are external "
"application roles. Boards supply physical resources without selecting the "
"product’s primary sensor."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:127
msgid ""
"role 映射和约束属于外部 consumer。它可在自己的构建步骤中读取 resolved 信息，检查 role 所需接口并生成类型化 alias "
"或访问器；平台不自动生成产品 role 政策。更换 physical binding 后，应用继续引用 role，而不是在业务源码里寻找具体 "
"UART/GPIO 编号。"
msgstr ""
"External consumers own role mappings/constraints. Their build steps may read "
"resolved information, validate required interfaces and generate typed "
"aliases/accessors. The platform generates no product role policy. After "
"rebinding hardware, applications still use roles rather than searching "
"business source for UART/GPIO numbers."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:129
msgid ""
"普通数据路径不需要运行时字符串查找。只读 wiring 放 Flash；必要 context、pool、queue 和 buffer 静态分配。role "
"alias 可编译为直接符号，通用 driver 只在需要窄端口时保留一层函数指针。不要为每个层名建立一层对象或虚调用。"
msgstr ""
"Ordinary data paths need no runtime string lookup. Read-only wiring resides "
"in Flash; required contexts, pools, queues and buffers are static. Role "
"aliases can compile to direct symbols; generic drivers retain one function-"
"pointer layer only where narrow ports require it. Layer names do not justify "
"extra objects or virtual calls."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:131
msgid "已实现的静态实例与 typed factory"
msgstr "Implemented static instances and typed factories"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:133
msgid ""
"factory 保留取得 typed 多态接口对象的架构骨架。生成器建立静态对象， factory "
"只返回已存在的身份，不创建、初始化、锁定或重配设备。公开 `nx_factory_uart(nx_uart_id_t)` 等类型化 getter；ID 是"
" `uint16_t` 和对应的 具名常量，越界、COUNT 和未选中类别返回 NULL。ID 只在当前 assembly 内有效， "
"不作为持久化格式或跨版本二进制 ABI。"
msgstr ""
"Factories preserve the typed polymorphic-interface architecture. Generators "
"create static objects; factories return existing identities without creating,"
" initializing, locking or reconfiguring devices. Typed getters include "
"`nx_factory_uart(nx_uart_id_t)`. IDs are `uint16_t` with named constants; "
"out-of-range, COUNT and unselected categories return NULL. IDs are assembly-"
"local, not persistent formats or cross-version binary ABIs."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:139
msgid ""
"每个公开 face 是只读的 `{ const ops*, void* context }`；32 位目标包含两个 指针，具体 Flash/RAM "
"成本由实际链接产物审核。每个 provider/mode 共享一张 `const ops`，可变状态和容量精确的数组独立拥有。方法接收实际 "
"context， 不会把共享 ops 对象当作实例。IRQ 静态进入具体 provider，不要求逐字节经过 虚调用。Native "
"多实例同样生成独立状态，单例只保留为明确的测试 fixture。"
msgstr ""
"Each public face is read-only `{ const ops*, void* context }`: two pointers "
"on 32-bit targets, with actual Flash/RAM audited from linked outputs. Each "
"provider/mode shares `const ops`; mutable state and exact-capacity arrays are"
" separate. Methods receive instance context, never treating shared ops as an "
"instance. IRQs statically enter providers without per-byte virtual dispatch. "
"Native instances also have separate generated state; singleton fixtures are "
"explicitly test-only."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "对象"
msgstr "Object"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "已实现的静态生成责任"
msgstr "Implemented static generation responsibility"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "controller port"
msgstr "controller port"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "独占控制器的一份必要状态和一个只读公共 face"
msgstr ""
"One necessary exclusive-controller state and one read-only public face."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "GPIO view"
msgstr "GPIO view"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "独立授权 mask 和方向；共享 GPIO 基座的不同 pin 分别校验"
msgstr ""
"Separate authorized masks/directions; validate different pins sharing the "
"GPIO base independently."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "bus endpoint"
msgstr "bus endpoint"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "SPI CS 或 I2C 地址各自拥有 face 和私有配置，不借第一项设备身份"
msgstr ""
"Each SPI CS or I2C address has its own face/private configuration, without "
"borrowing the first device’s identity."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "mode storage"
msgstr "mode storage"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "只分配所选 UART/EXTI profile、容量和显式 Native register model"
msgstr ""
"Allocate only selected UART/EXTI profiles, capacities and explicit Native "
"register models."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "typed factory"
msgstr "typed factory"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "纯静态 switch；无注册、字符串查找、heap、hidden worker"
msgstr ""
"Pure static switch; no registration, string lookup, heap or hidden workers."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "ops"
msgstr "ops"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "同 provider/mode 共享只读表；不同实现保持相同公共接口布局"
msgstr ""
"Instances of the same provider/mode share a read-only table; different "
"implementations keep the same public interface layout."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "IRQ wiring"
msgstr "IRQ wiring"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "固定实例直接分发；真实共享 EXTI 使用有界静态 dispatcher"
msgstr ""
"Fixed instances dispatch directly; genuinely shared EXTI uses bounded static "
"dispatchers."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "startup"
msgstr "startup"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "显式串行调用与逆序清理，BUSY 保留进度和所有被借用的存储"
msgstr ""
"Explicit serial calls and reverse cleanup; BUSY retains progress and all "
"borrowed storage."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "外部 composition 提供存储、窄端口和调度，不自动生成业务实例"
msgstr ""
"External composition provides storage, narrow ports and scheduling without "
"generated business instances."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:157
msgid ""
"`nx_binding_<bus>` 和 `nx_factory_spi/i2c` 都返回真实 controller port； "
"`nx_device_<child>` 和 `nx_factory_spi_device/i2c_device` 返回具体 endpoint。 公共 "
"I2C recovery 因此始终可取得 bus 身份。应用不能再把 bus alias 当作 第一项 endpoint。poll 与 async "
"mode 的资源和能力分别实现，不由 getter 隐式改变。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_binding_<bus>` and `nx_factory_spi/i2c` return actual controller ports; "
"`nx_device_<child>` and `nx_factory_spi_device/i2c_device` return endpoints. "
"Public I2C recovery therefore always has bus identity. Applications cannot "
"treat bus aliases as the first endpoint. Polling and asynchronous modes "
"implement resources/capabilities separately; getters never switch modes "
"implicitly."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:163
msgid ""
"装配写 TOML schema 2；`authored.py` 的同一字段模型提供严格解析和 editor schema。冻结的 "
"`ControllerIR/EndpointIR/MemoryBudgetIR/ConfigurationIR` 直接供 emitter "
"使用，`resolved.json` 是这个决策的序列化。 `configure.py init/list-"
"bindings/check/explain/generate` 均使用同一解析器。 CMake 从 resolver 的 input paths "
"加入精确重配置依赖，不重解析 TOML。"
msgstr ""
"Assemblies use TOML schema 2; one `authored.py` field model provides strict "
"parsing and editor schemas. Frozen "
"`ControllerIR/EndpointIR/MemoryBudgetIR/ConfigurationIR` feeds emitters "
"directly; `resolved.json` serializes the decisions. `configure.py init/list-"
"bindings/check/explain/generate` share the resolver. CMake adds exact "
"reconfiguration dependencies from resolver input paths without reparsing "
"TOML."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:169
msgid ""
"STM32 USART1 `dma-tx` 使用固定 DMA2 stream7 channel4，RX 保持独立 IRQ ring。 DMA "
"可达域与动态指针校验、memory-engine detach、UART TC wire drain 分别验证； 不能把 NDTR=0 当作串口完成。不同"
" selector 对同一个 physical stream 仍冲突。 其它硬件 DMA/stream 模式只按各自代码、模型、链接和物理证据声明支持。"
msgstr ""
"STM32 USART1 `dma-tx` uses fixed DMA2 stream7 channel4; RX retains its "
"separate IRQ ring. DMA domains/runtime pointer validation, memory-engine "
"detach and UART TC wire draining are verified separately; NDTR=0 is not UART "
"completion. Different selectors for one physical stream still conflict. Other"
" DMA/stream modes claim support only within their own "
"code/model/link/physical evidence."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:174
msgid ""
"得到静态 face 不改变启动状态，也不授予并发执行权。取消、timeout、stop 和 restart 都不能提前撤销请求 borrow；仅 "
"acquire-observed SETTLED 允许回收。 共享路径由显式 owner 执行者推进，产品拥有任务与 recovery policy。"
msgstr ""
"Obtaining a static face neither changes startup state nor grants concurrent "
"execution rights. Cancel, timeout, stop and restart cannot revoke request "
"borrows early; only acquire-observed SETTLED permits reclamation. Explicit "
"owner executors advance shared paths; products own tasks and recovery policy."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:178
msgid ""
"源码 SDK 包含公共接口、严格配置工具和精确依赖身份。代码/注释保持当前格式； 行为改动使用先失败后实现的 TDD，主机 "
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock 与生产 C11 驱动 分开链接。源码 SDK 的普通固件不包含测试框架。"
msgstr ""
"Source SDKs contain public interfaces, strict configuration tools and exact "
"dependency identities. Code/comments preserve current style. Behavior changes"
" use failing-tests-first TDD; host GoogleTest/GoogleMock links separately "
"from production C11 drivers. Ordinary SDK firmware contains no testing "
"framework."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:182
msgid "7. 新 Board 接入流程"
msgstr "7. New Board integration process"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:184
msgid ""
"收集精确 MCU、PCB/document revision、原理图/BOM来源、晶振、电源、SWD、连接器、跳线和默认电平。未知的实际 PCB "
"revision 保持 null。"
msgstr ""
"Collect exact MCU, PCB/document revisions, schematic/BOM sources, "
"oscillators, supplies, SWD, connectors, jumpers and default levels. Unknown "
"actual PCB revisions remain null."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:185
msgid "确认 SoC 已有维护实现，选择最小资源，例如 LED 加一条 UART。逐条核对 route，不默认覆盖全部连接器。"
msgstr ""
"Confirm maintained SoC implementation and select minimal resources, such as "
"an LED and UART. Review each route without assuming all connectors are "
"supported."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:186
msgid "编写 `board.json`、README；特殊电源/复位动作才增加中性 Board hook。标明已复核来源与未执行的物理项。"
msgstr ""
"Write `board.json` and README; add neutral Board hooks only for special "
"power/reset actions. Identify reviewed sources and unexecuted physical items."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:187
msgid ""
"在外部仓库创建 `assembly.toml` 和显式 main，先选择裸机，再构建实际 ARM "
"ELF/map/BIN。检查资源计划、时钟、内存、ABI、vector 和 handler。"
msgstr ""
"Create an external `assembly.toml` and explicit main; begin with bare metal "
"and build actual ARM ELF/map/BIN. Check resource plans, clocks, memory, ABI, "
"vectors and handlers."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:188
msgid ""
"为同一资源创建 FreeRTOS assembly，检查 port、timebase、IRQ priority 和静态预算；两个 backend 使用独立"
" build root。"
msgstr ""
"Create a FreeRTOS assembly for those resources and check port, timebase, IRQ "
"priority and static budgets. Use separate roots for both backends."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:189
msgid "在支持矩阵记录精确 tuple 和实际软件证据。没有接实板时，物理初始化、电气、IRQ/DMA 与长期运行全部保持未执行。"
msgstr ""
"Record exact tuples and actual software evidence. Without hardware, physical "
"initialization, electrical behavior, IRQ/DMA and long runs remain not "
"executed."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:191
msgid ""
"首发三板的 MCU I2C、SPI route/模式及 RS485 收发器/DE/RE 都须逐项查明维护实现和接线条件，不能从 Board "
"名推导可用。现有启明资料中的 SPI disabled、RS485 条件未核实、实际 PCB revision 未记录等限制，不会被本提案自动解除。"
msgstr ""
"Individually establish maintained MCU I2C/SPI routes/modes and RS485 "
"transceiver/DE/RE wiring on all three initial Boards. Names do not establish "
"availability. This proposal does not automatically remove Qiming’s disabled "
"SPI, unverified RS485 conditions or missing actual PCB revision."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:193
msgid "8. 新 SoC 或精确 SKU 接入流程"
msgstr "8. New SoC or exact-SKU integration process"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:195
msgid "明确是已有 SoC 的新封装/密度，还是新的寄存器/clock/IRQ/DMA实现；不要仅按市场家族名分类。"
msgstr ""
"Distinguish new packages/densities from new register/clock/IRQ/DMA "
"implementations rather than classifying solely by marketing family."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:196
msgid "锁定官方资料、勘误、SDK revision、许可和 import hash，记录精确 part/package/density。"
msgstr ""
"Pin official documents, errata, SDK revisions, licenses and import hashes; "
"record exact part/package/density."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:197
msgid ""
"定义 `soc.json` 的物理 memory、Flash geometry、clock 约束、IRQ 和 controller；最初只放入准备维护的 "
"reviewed routes。"
msgstr ""
"Define physical memory, Flash geometry, clock constraints, IRQs and "
"controllers in `soc.json`. Initially include only reviewed routes intended "
"for maintenance."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:198
msgid ""
"实现 Arch 所需适配、reset/startup、clock、timebase、IRQ、linker 和最小 IO provider。SDK 目标保持"
" PRIVATE，不暴露厂商结构体给外部 consumer。"
msgstr ""
"Implement required Arch adapters, reset/startup, clocks, timebase, IRQs, "
"linker and minimum I/O providers. SDK targets stay PRIVATE; no vendor "
"structures leak to consumers."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:199
msgid ""
"先建立最小 ELF 链接 fixture，再完成裸机和 FreeRTOS port/config "
"的实际编译链接；对错误、资源终态和取消等有行为的路径建立必要模型证据。"
msgstr ""
"Start with minimal ELF link fixtures, then compile/link actual bare-metal and"
" FreeRTOS ports/configurations. Establish necessary model evidence for "
"behavioral error, terminal-resource and cancellation paths."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:200
msgid "新 controller/route/DMA 模式分别扩大矩阵。SDK 中存在但尚无 provider 的功能不成为可选维护能力。"
msgstr ""
"Expand matrices separately for new controllers/routes/DMA modes. SDK features"
" without providers do not become selectable maintained capabilities."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:201
msgid "没有实板资格时，交付状态只到实际完成的软件项。不能由相近芯片的结果继承物理支持。"
msgstr ""
"Without physical qualification, delivery reaches only executed software "
"items. Related-chip results do not confer physical support."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:203
msgid "9. 新外部器件 driver 接入流程"
msgstr "9. New external device-driver integration process"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:205
msgid "以 BME280 SPI driver 为例；例子不声称三块首发 Board 已存在 reviewed SPI 接线。"
msgstr ""
"Consider a BME280 SPI driver; this example does not claim reviewed SPI wiring"
" on the three initial Boards."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:207
msgid ""
"确认所用 Board 已提供 reviewed SPI binding、CS 和电气条件。没有时，先独立完成 SoC route/controller 与"
" Board wiring 接入。"
msgstr ""
"Confirm reviewed SPI bindings, CS and electrical conditions. Otherwise first "
"integrate SoC routes/controllers and Board wiring independently."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:208
msgid ""
"创建器件 core：公共头、实现和 CMake；定义有界 context 与窄 transaction/time 端口。器件寄存器、chip-"
"ID、校准解析和转换算法归 driver。"
msgstr ""
"Create device-core public headers, implementation and CMake; define bounded "
"contexts and narrow transaction/time ports. Drivers own registers, chip-ID, "
"calibration parsing and conversion algorithms."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:209
msgid ""
"声明必需 bus mode/word width/频率、初始化时序、ISR/task 限制、timeout 起点、buffer 借用、失败后的状态和 "
"recovery 条件。"
msgstr ""
"Declare required bus modes/word widths/frequencies, initialization timing, "
"ISR/task restrictions, timeout origins, buffer borrows, post-failure states "
"and recovery conditions."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:210
msgid ""
"外部 assembly 创建 `bme280_ext0`，绑定 bus child/CS 和固定容量；CMake 显式链接 driver 和其 "
"adapter。"
msgstr ""
"External assemblies create `bme280_ext0` with bus child/CS and fixed "
"capacities; CMake explicitly links drivers and adapters."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:211
msgid ""
"consumer 自己映射 `ambient_sensor` role。裸机 main 周期调用，FreeRTOS product worker 调用同一"
" driver，平台不自动创建任务。"
msgstr ""
"Consumers map `ambient_sensor` themselves. Bare-metal main calls "
"periodically; FreeRTOS product workers call the same driver. The platform "
"creates no automatic task."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:212
msgid ""
"用 fake port 验证解析、错误响应、deadline 与 ownership 等行为；实际 ARM 链接验证接口、容量和装配。chip-ID "
"检查属于实例初始化，不是自动扫描设备。"
msgstr ""
"Fake ports verify parsing, error responses, deadlines and ownership. Actual "
"ARM links verify interfaces, capacity and assembly. Chip-ID checks belong to "
"instance initialization, not device scanning."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:213
msgid "真实接线、波形、传感误差和长期负载单独资格化。没有硬件时，只记录实际完成的软件证据。"
msgstr ""
"Qualify real wiring, waveforms, sensor error and sustained loads separately. "
"Without hardware, record only executed software evidence."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:215
msgid ""
"器件 driver 不把 Flash 总线存储自动称为产品 Storage，也不自动分配产品 region；例如 W25Q 还需要实际 fitted "
"part、容量、erase geometry 和外部布局策略。"
msgstr ""
"Device drivers do not automatically make Flash-bus storage product Storage or"
" reserve product regions. W25Q, for example, needs actual fitted-part, "
"capacity, erase-geometry facts and external layout policy."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:217
msgid "10. 新 protocol / component 接入流程"
msgstr "10. New protocol/component integration process"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:219
msgid "判断是否通用且值得平台维护；客户私有协议、产品流程和领域控制留在外部仓库。"
msgstr ""
"Establish reuse value and platform-maintenance worth. Customer-private "
"protocols, product flows and domain control stay external."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:220
msgid ""
"定义无 Board/SDK 依赖的 core，固定最大帧长/节点数/工作区及失败语义。协议 parser 不能隐式打开 UART 或创建 task。"
msgstr ""
"Define Board/SDK-independent cores with fixed maximum frame lengths, node "
"counts, workspaces and failure semantics. Parsers must not implicitly open "
"UARTs or create tasks."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:221
msgid "用窄 transport/time/storage 等端口连接环境，必要 adapter 独立可选；CMake 明确其代码依赖。"
msgstr ""
"Connect through narrow transport/time/storage ports with separately optional "
"adapters; CMake declares code dependencies explicitly."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:222
msgid "external assembly 只选择 transport 的硬件资源，产品显式配置协议 role、调度与 worker。"
msgstr ""
"External assemblies select only transport hardware resources; products "
"explicitly configure protocol roles, scheduling and workers."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:223
msgid "验证用户可见协议行为、无效输入、边界和资源耗尽，建立真实固件链接。电气和帧 timing 资格仍需物理证据。"
msgstr ""
"Verify observable protocol behavior, invalid inputs, boundaries and "
"exhaustion, and link actual firmware. Electrical and frame-timing "
"qualification still needs physical evidence."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:225
msgid ""
"RS485 特别需要 Board/外部 wiring 说明收发器、电平、DE/RE、隔离和终端条件；SoC UART provider "
"负责已维护传输终态；协议/adapter 明确何时切换方向。不能用软件 delay 或 generic UART 成功返回代替真实 TC 和线路资格。"
msgstr ""
"RS485 needs Board/external wiring facts for transceivers, levels, DE/RE, "
"isolation and termination. SoC UART providers own maintained transfer "
"terminal states; protocols/adapters define direction-switch timing. Software "
"delays or generic UART success cannot replace actual TC and line "
"qualification."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:227
msgid "11. 外部源码 SDK 消费与升级"
msgstr "11. External source-SDK consumption and upgrades"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:229
msgid "一个外部工程通常只需："
msgstr "An external project normally needs only:"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:241
msgid ""
"消费流程是固定 source SDK/commit 和依赖 lock，完成 package 校验，用其公开 CMake "
"入口接入，再在外部目标显式链接平台能力与组件。CMake preset 选择工具链/build mode，assembly "
"选择硬件与后端，两个输入职责不重复。"
msgstr ""
"Pin source SDK/commit and dependency locks, verify packages, integrate "
"through public CMake entry points, then explicitly link platform "
"capabilities/components. CMake presets select toolchains/build modes; "
"assemblies select hardware/backends. Their responsibilities do not overlap."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:243
msgid ""
"SDK 准备和消费必须使用完整、固定依赖的源码；缺失 submodule 或 snapshot 不能默认为可发布 SDK。source package "
"需要清单、许可证、相对 CMake 配置及输入身份，移动后进行实际 consumer 验证。路径可重定位不是 ABI 兼容证明。"
msgstr ""
"SDK preparation/consumption requires complete source with pinned "
"dependencies. Missing submodules or snapshots are not silently releasable "
"SDKs. Packages include manifests, licenses, relative CMake configurations and"
" input identities, followed by actual consumer verification after relocation."
" Relocatability does not prove ABI compatibility."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:245
msgid ""
"升级 PR 同时修改平台 pin、调用者和需要的 assembly/schema。破坏性合同升级明确版本和迁移说明，重新执行精确支持 tuple "
"的软件回归；不把旧版本结果继承到新 source/config。正式产品 promotion 使用已审核的同一 artifact "
"digest，不能默默重建另一份镜像。"
msgstr ""
"Upgrade PRs change platform pins, callers and necessary assemblies/schemas "
"together. Breaking contracts specify versions and migration instructions, "
"then rerun exact support-tuple software regressions. Old-source/configuration"
" results do not qualify new inputs. Product promotion uses reviewed identical"
" artifact digests without silent rebuilding."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:247
msgid ""
"bootloader、A/B、签名、回滚、制造与现场升级由外部产品拥有。layout、image offset "
"或持久化格式变更需要产品迁移/恢复合同及对应资格；源码 SDK 更新不会自动替代这些工作。"
msgstr ""
"External products own bootloaders, A/B, signing, rollback, manufacturing and "
"field updates. Layout, image-offset and persistent-format changes need "
"product migration/recovery contracts and qualification; source-SDK upgrades "
"do not do that work automatically."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:249
msgid "12. 版本、路径、摘要与产物身份"
msgstr "12. Versions, paths, digests and artifact identity"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:251
msgid ""
"SoC/Board/assembly/resolved 分别有明确 schema version；未知 "
"version、未知字段或矛盾值拒绝，不静默忽略。确需扩展时使用受控 namespace，不能隐藏有效编译选项。"
msgstr ""
"SoC/Board/assembly/resolved inputs have explicit schema versions. Reject "
"unknown versions/fields and contradictions rather than silently ignoring "
"them. Necessary extensions use controlled namespaces without hiding effective"
" compile options."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:252
msgid "package 记录 API/contract version、精确依赖 revision 和来源；schema 兼容不等于硬件或行为兼容。"
msgstr ""
"Packages record API/contract versions, exact dependency revisions and "
"origins. Schema compatibility does not establish hardware or behavioral "
"compatibility."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:253
msgid ""
"相对路径以拥有该 manifest 的目录为基准。Board source 必须落在自己的 package 内；拒绝 `..`、symlink "
"逃逸和未声明 source。SDK 自身路径不能误用 consumer ancestor 的 Git 身份。"
msgstr ""
"Relative paths are anchored to their owning manifests. Board source stays "
"inside its package; reject `..`, symlink escapes and undeclared source. SDK "
"paths must not inherit consumer-ancestor Git identity accidentally."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:254
msgid ""
"所有影响构建的输入均声明并 hash，包括 route 数据、Board hooks、layout、vendor import、代码依赖 "
"lock、工具链和编译选项。hash 原始字节用于输入身份，规范化 resolved JSON 用于有效配置身份；算法和格式有版本。"
msgstr ""
"Declare and hash all build-affecting inputs: routes, Board hooks, layouts, "
"vendor imports, dependency locks, toolchains and compile options. Raw-byte "
"hashes identify inputs; normalized resolved JSON identifies effective "
"configuration. Algorithms/formats are versioned."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:255
msgid "解析或构建过程中不偷偷联网更新依赖。目录内新增但未声明的有效 source 必须被拒绝或重新加入清单，不能绕过身份校验。"
msgstr ""
"Do not update dependencies over the network secretly during resolution/build."
" New effective sources not declared in manifests must fail or be added "
"explicitly; directory additions cannot bypass identity checks."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:256
msgid "外部产品身份与平台身份分开。平台提供料号/Board/config 等中性信息，不拥有产品名、SKU 或制造政策。"
msgstr ""
"Product and platform identities are separate. Platforms supply neutral "
"part/Board/configuration facts without owning product names, SKUs or "
"manufacturing policy."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:257
msgid ""
"产物清单绑定平台及 consumer revision、依赖、工具链、SoC/Board/assembly/resolved/layout hash，以及"
" ELF/BIN/map digest 和证据范围。"
msgstr ""
"Artifact manifests bind platform/consumer revisions, dependencies, "
"toolchains, SoC/Board/assembly/resolved/layout hashes, ELF/BIN/map digests "
"and evidence scope."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:258
msgid ""
"dirty 开发构建可显式允许，但标记 `publishable=false`；缺输入、hash 不一致、旧证据或 snapshot 不能升级为发布资格。"
msgstr ""
"Dirty development builds may be explicitly allowed but are marked "
"`publishable=false`. Missing inputs, hash mismatches, stale evidence and "
"snapshots cannot gain release qualification."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:260
msgid "13. 支持 tuple 与支持等级"
msgstr "13. Support tuples and evidence levels"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:262
msgid "支持最小单元为："
msgstr "The minimum support unit is:"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:271
msgid ""
"Board 名只是检索入口，不是整板所有外设都受支持的承诺。一个 UART IRQ tuple 的结果不能证明同 Board 的 SPI "
"DMA、I2C、RS485或另一个 backend。"
msgstr ""
"Board names are lookup aids, not promises for all onboard peripherals. UART "
"IRQ tuple results do not qualify SPI DMA, I2C, RS485 or another backend on "
"that Board."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "记录项"
msgstr "Record"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "可证明范围"
msgstr "Established scope"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "不证明"
msgstr "Not established"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "D：描述复核"
msgstr "D: description review"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "指定资料中的料号、接线、route 已审阅"
msgstr "Part, wiring and routes reviewed in named source documents."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "真实 fitted part、PCB、线路可用"
msgstr "Actual fitted parts, PCBs or usable wiring."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "C：编译/链接"
msgstr "C: compile/link"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "指定工具链下真实 ARM ELF、布局和装配通过"
msgstr "Actual ARM ELF, layout and assembly pass with the specified toolchain."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "硬件已运行、时序正确"
msgstr "Hardware execution or correct timing."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "M：模型行为"
msgstr "M: model behavior"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "指定 source/config 的 host/fake 行为通过"
msgstr "Host/fake behavior passes for exact source/configuration."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "电气、IRQ/DMA 实际终态"
msgstr "Electrical behavior or actual IRQ/DMA terminal states."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "H：物理路径"
msgstr "H: physical paths"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "指定 PCB、route、mode 的真实测量"
msgstr "Actual measurements for exact PCB, route and mode."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "任意负载、其他外设或整产品资格"
msgstr "Arbitrary loads, other peripherals or complete-product qualification."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "Q：产品负载资格"
msgstr "Q: product workload qualification"

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "指定 workload、预算和产品策略下验收"
msgstr "Acceptance under named workloads, budgets and product policy."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:0
msgid "其他产品、无限支持期限或 LTS"
msgstr "Other products, unlimited support windows or LTS."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:281
msgid ""
"这些是分列证据维度，而不是以模型结果替代编译或硬件的单一等级。C/M/H/Q 缺项必须明确写未执行；日志、工件、source/config "
"和预算绑定到同一个 tuple。"
msgstr ""
"These are separate evidence dimensions, not one hierarchy letting models "
"replace compilation/hardware. Missing C/M/H/Q evidence is explicitly not "
"executed. Logs, artifacts, source/configuration and budgets bind the same "
"tuple."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:283
msgid ""
"首阶段可建立三板 × 两后端的六个基础软件装配组合，但每个组合只能声明实际选入并执行的路径。I2C/SPI/RS485 和 DMA "
"按维护事实扩列。没有连接硬件时 H/Q 为空；角色名单、workflow 和 fixture 不填补这一缺口。"
msgstr ""
"The first stage may establish six base software combinations: three Boards × "
"two backends. Each claims only paths actually selected and executed. Expand "
"I2C/SPI/RS485/DMA columns by maintained facts. Without hardware, H/Q remain "
"empty; role lists, workflows and fixtures do not fill that gap."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:285
msgid ""
"10 人、3–6 个月优先完成窄 schema、六个基础 firmware 组合、确有需要的 controller/driver 和可审核工件。完整 "
"pin 数据库、全 SDK feature、自动拓扑求解和运行时探测不作为首阶段退出条件。"
msgstr ""
"With ten people and 3–6 months, prioritize narrow schemas, six base firmware "
"combinations, needed controllers/drivers and reviewable artifacts. Complete "
"pin databases, all SDK features, automatic topology solving and runtime "
"discovery are not first-stage exit criteria."

#: docs/design/integration-contracts.md:53
msgid ""
"当前生产源码只有 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`，私有共享 IP 位于其 `drivers/ip/`。 Board／SoC 不放 Python"
" 插件；当前 F4 配置适配集中在 `tools/configure/stm32f4/`， 通用 schema、resolver、typed IR "
"与原子输出仍由公共工具维护。Native 仅在 `tests/support/native/`，必须显式启用测试 scope；不会进入生产支持枚举。 "
"CPU 实现按 ISA 位于 `arch/arm/cortex_m/` 或 `arch/native/`，公共头路径保持稳定。 默认生成入口连接 "
"Core 的手写 C 整平台生命周期和 F4 的 System／共享资源 C 协调器。 "
"主机保留事实校验与静态连接，不维护硬件算法或启动／撤回控制流。Host C11 是独立 可选试点，其全面替换不作为固件 C 化或交付前置。实际生成 "
"factory、C 模型与 ARM 镜像分别验收，不能用目录调整或源码存在宣布整条链路通过。"
msgstr ""
"Current production sources contain only `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`, with private "
"shared IP under its `drivers/ip/`. Board and SoC packages contain no Python "
"plugins. F4 configuration adaptation is centralized in "
"`tools/configure/stm32f4/`; common tools still own the schema, resolver, "
"typed IR and atomic output. Native lives only in `tests/support/native/`, "
"requires explicit test scope and never enters production support "
"enumeration. CPU implementations follow their ISA under `arch/arm/cortex_m/`"
" or `arch/native/`, with stable public header paths. The default generated "
"entry connects Core's handwritten C whole-platform lifecycle and F4's "
"System/shared-resource C coordinator. The host retains fact validation and "
"static connections, not hardware algorithms or startup/withdrawal control "
"flow. Host C11 is an independent optional pilot; full replacement is not a "
"prerequisite for firmware behavior in C or delivery. Generated factories, C "
"models and ARM images are accepted separately; directory changes or source "
"presence do not establish a pass for the whole path."
